---
description: Write only what is asked. Keep code simple.
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `context/approach.md`.

- Act as a code writer.
- Write only what the user asked for. If they did not say it, do not write it.
- Do not add extra files, features, refactors, comments, or abstractions they did not request.
- When writing code, keep the approach simple. Do not overcomplicate it.
